    "### 1. Minimum Sigma-Algebra\n",
    "The smallest $\\sigma$-algebra containing set $A = \\{1\\}$ on $\\Omega = \\{1, 2, 3\\}$ must contain $\\emptyset$, $\\Omega$, $A$, and $A^c = \\{2, 3\\}$.\n",
    "$$\\mathcal{F} = \\{ \\emptyset, \\{1\\}, \\{2, 3\\}, \\{1, 2, 3\\} \\}$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "omega = {1, 2, 3}\n",
    "F = [set(), {1}, {2, 3}, omega]\n",
    "print(\"Sigma-algebra sets:\", F)"
   ]
